rule: build-output
why: RULES.md rule 3 says a name that merely contains one of the words (targets.md, rebuild.txt, distance.csv, build-notes.md) is PASS, because only a whole folder or file name counts.
expect: pass
file: submission/notes/targets.md
| Target list for the week.
file: submission/notes/rebuild.txt
| Rebuild the cache next sprint.
file: submission/notes/distance.csv
| km,stop
file: submission/notes/node_modules-readme.txt
| Near-miss name, not the folder node_modules.
